# proto-message: nexteggapp.taxprotos.common.v1.FormMapping
#
# What Form IT-540 calls each concept, per tax year.
#
# Lines come from the 2025 Form IT-540-WEB-BC as the Louisiana Department of
# Revenue publishes it, including Schedule E. There are no amount codes: IRS
# Publication 1220 covers the information returns the IRS receives
# electronically, and a state return is not one of them.

